# 统一行尾：Windows 检出时 shell hook / Python / JS 必须保持 LF，
# 否则 .githooks/pre-commit 会因 \r 报错导致提交门禁静默失效。
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows 批处理保留 CRLF
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf

# 二进制一律不参与换行转换
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.ico binary
*.hap binary
*.exe binary
*.zip binary
*.p12 binary
*.cer binary
*.pyd binary
*.dll binary
